   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
  {
   "step": "原因",
   "fact": "Image 加载成功且组件不设宽高时，显示大小自适应父组件；加载失败或图片尺寸为 0 时组件大小为 0",
   "source": "https://gitcode.com/openharmony/docs/blob/master/zh-cn/application-dev/reference/apis-arkui/arkui-ts/ts-basic-components-image.md，接口",
   "kind": "鸿蒙接口",
   "origin": "沿用并复核"
  },
